    %% ─── Frontend dependencies ──────────────────────────
    core -->|used by| features
    features.auth -->|online-first (JWT via ApiClient)| core.network
    features.stories -->|online-first + SQLite mirror| core.network
    features.library -->|LOCAL SQLite facade| core.database
    features.qr_scanner -->|API lookup + record scan| core.network
    features.audio -->|/api/media/audio + status| core.network
    features.audio -->|offline audio cache| core.database
    features.video -->|/api/media/videos + status| core.network
    features.gamification -->|LOCAL SQLite facade| core.database
    features.sharing -->|/api/stories/{slug}/share| core.network
    features.admin -->|/api/analytics/*| core.network
    features.artifacts -->|/api/artifacts| core.network
    features.discover -->|/api/categories| core.network
    features.settings -->|wa.me chat (url_launcher)| WhatsApp
    core.network -->|offline queue| core.database
    core.offline -->|error reporting (client)| Sentry
    %% ─── Backend / external ─────────────────────────────
    core.network ..> Django REST API : HTTPS
    media_app -->|REST (mock if no LUMA_API_KEY)| LumaAiAPI
    media_app -->|gTTS (no key required)| TTSProvider
    crawler -->|discover-cameroon.com → cameroon_content.json| CrawlSource
    crawler ..> Django REST API : import_crawl_data command → Artifact

